{"about_the_game":"Figure Drawing Garden is an immersive virtual garden designed for you to practice and improve at figure drawing - an essential skill for any artist as it trains the ability to capture gesture, anatomy, weight, balance, tension and emotion. Grab your sketchbook, relax, explore and draw in your very own Figure Drawing Garden.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/optimized-procedural-generation.gif?t=1733921472\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/figure-drawing-garden-header-features.png?t=1733921472\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/figure-drawing-garden-subheader-sculptures.png?t=1733921472\" /><br>A collection of exquisite 3D scanned classical and renaissance sculptures for you to draw. Curated to provide accurate anatomy, dynamic poses and a variety of body types.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/optimized-sculptures.gif?t=1733921472\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/figure-drawing-garden-subheader-generation.png?t=1733921472\" /><br>Explore your very own infinite virtual garden. Filled with towering monuments, intricate fountains, mazes, forests and courtyards.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/optimized-procedural-generation.gif?t=1733921472\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/figure-drawing-garden-subheader-challenges.png?t=1733921472\" /><br>Challenge modifiers will push you out of your comfort zone and introduce new techniques.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/optimized-challenge-modifiers.gif?t=1733921472\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/figure-drawing-garden-subheader-light-and-shadow.png?t=1733921472\" /><br>Practicing your shading? Simply enter Dynamic Lighting mode and light the figure as you desire.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/optimized-dynamic-lighting.gif?t=1733921472\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/figure-drawing-garden-subheader-beginner-friendly.png?t=1733921472\" /><br>Figure Drawing Garden's Simplified Form and Perspective Grid tools are just what you need to get started.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/optimized-beginner-friendly.gif?t=1733921472\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/figure-drawing-garden-subheader-flow.png?t=1733921472\" /><br>Through its tranquil environment and optional Soundscapes, Figure Drawing Garden is designed to help you reach a state of flow.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/optimized-find-your-flow.gif?t=1733921472\" /><br><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/figure-drawing-garden-header-community.png?t=1733921472\" /><br><br>Join our Discord to share your drawings, get inspired, and suggest features you'd like to see added in future updates!<br><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/wishlist-figure-drawing-garden.gif?t=1733921472\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2594620?t=1733921472","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2594620?t=1733921472","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/401b5302118f841509ea464b94fbf21faeb6aad2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1733921472","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/401b5302118f841509ea464b94fbf21faeb6aad2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1733921472","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game contains 3D scans of nude sculptures."},"detailed_description":"Figure Drawing Garden is an immersive virtual garden designed for you to practice and improve at figure drawing - an essential skill for any artist as it trains the ability to capture gesture, anatomy, weight, balance, tension and emotion. Grab your sketchbook, relax, explore and draw in your very own Figure Drawing Garden.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/optimized-procedural-generation.gif?t=1733921472\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/figure-drawing-garden-header-features.png?t=1733921472\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/figure-drawing-garden-subheader-sculptures.png?t=1733921472\" /><br>A collection of exquisite 3D scanned classical and renaissance sculptures for you to draw. Curated to provide accurate anatomy, dynamic poses and a variety of body types.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/optimized-sculptures.gif?t=1733921472\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/figure-drawing-garden-subheader-generation.png?t=1733921472\" /><br>Explore your very own infinite virtual garden. Filled with towering monuments, intricate fountains, mazes, forests and courtyards.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/optimized-procedural-generation.gif?t=1733921472\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/figure-drawing-garden-subheader-challenges.png?t=1733921472\" /><br>Challenge modifiers will push you out of your comfort zone and introduce new techniques.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/optimized-challenge-modifiers.gif?t=1733921472\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/figure-drawing-garden-subheader-light-and-shadow.png?t=1733921472\" /><br>Practicing your shading? Simply enter Dynamic Lighting mode and light the figure as you desire.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/optimized-dynamic-lighting.gif?t=1733921472\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/figure-drawing-garden-subheader-beginner-friendly.png?t=1733921472\" /><br>Figure Drawing Garden's Simplified Form and Perspective Grid tools are just what you need to get started.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/optimized-beginner-friendly.gif?t=1733921472\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/figure-drawing-garden-subheader-flow.png?t=1733921472\" /><br>Through its tranquil environment and optional Soundscapes, Figure Drawing Garden is designed to help you reach a state of flow.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/optimized-find-your-flow.gif?t=1733921472\" /><br><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/figure-drawing-garden-header-community.png?t=1733921472\" /><br><br>Join our Discord to share your drawings, get inspired, and suggest features you'd like to see added in future updates!<br><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/wishlist-figure-drawing-garden.gif?t=1733921472\" />","developers":["Josh O'Caoimh"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/header.jpg?t=1733921472","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 ALL RIGHTS RESERVED. FIGURE DRAWING GARDEN 2023.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-1135G7 2.42GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Xe Graphics</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Catalina<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.2 GHz Quad-Core Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 755M 1GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257080967,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257080967/movie480.mp4?t=1733921464","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257080967/movie_max.mp4?t=1